---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Terms"
  description="The terms that govern your use of deload."
>
  <section class="px-6 pt-20 pb-24 md:pt-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink/50">Terms</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-medium leading-[1.1] tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
        Terms of service
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink/50">Last updated: TBD</p>

      {/* TODO: replace this placeholder with reviewed legal copy before launch. */}
      <div class="prose mt-10 max-w-none text-ink/80">
        <p class="text-lg">
          This is placeholder copy. The final terms will cover account use, acceptable conduct, billing (once paid plans exist), uptime expectations, and how disputes are handled.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-medium text-ink">Using deload</h2>
        <p>You agree to use deload to coach real humans, not to scrape it, and not to use it for anything illegal or harmful.</p>
        <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-medium text-ink">Your content</h2>
        <p>You own the programs you write. We have a limited license to host them so the product can work.</p>
        <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-medium text-ink">Changes</h2>
        <p>We'll let you know inside the app before we make material changes to these terms.</p>
        <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-ink/50">
          Questions? Reach us via the contact page.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
